### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 1: Create a course
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8085/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Microservices",
  "description": "Learn to build production-grade microservices with Spring Boot, Kafka, and Docker",
  "level": "INTERMEDIATE",
  "tags": ["java", "spring", "microservices", "kafka"]
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 2: Publish the course
### Paste course id from STEP 1
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8085/api/courses/PASTE_COURSE_ID/publish
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 3: Get all courses
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8085/api/courses

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 4: Enroll in the course
### Use a different email to simulate another user
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8085/api/courses/PASTE_COURSE_ID/enroll
X-User-Email: jane@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 5: Generate AI quiz for the course
### Requires ai-service running on 8084
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8085/api/quizzes/generate
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: jane@devflow.com

{
  "courseId": "PASTE_COURSE_ID",
  "questionCount": 5,
  "topic": "Spring Boot basics"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 6: Submit quiz answers
### Paste quiz id from STEP 5
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8085/api/quizzes/PASTE_QUIZ_ID/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: jane@devflow.com

{
  "answers": {
    "PASTE_QUESTION_ID_1": 0,
    "PASTE_QUESTION_ID_2": 1
  }
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 7: Check progress
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8085/api/courses/PASTE_COURSE_ID/progress
X-User-Email: jane@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 8: Get my enrolled courses
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8085/api/courses/my-courses
X-User-Email: jane@devflow.com